  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Added Premier, Esports, Mailbox, Goldstars, and Activities endpoints (thanks @PrometheuzzZ for the docs)\n- Fixed a real TLS bug: remote HTTP calls were accepting any certificate, not just the local client's self-signed one\n- Fixed GetCurrentGameLoadoutsAsync hitting the wrong URL, and DeclinePartyAsync hitting the same endpoint as RequestPartyAsync\n- Filled in missing Party/Store/Contract/PVP/Chat endpoints\n- Updated agent/map/weapon/currency tables to match live Valorant data, added an Accolade table for goldstars\n- Riot TOS compliance fixes, driver auth fixes, various disposal/cleanup fixes",
